window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A loan office hiding from the local pack. A werewolf, recently returned to town. Can these two find common ground amid a slew of crime and intrigue? Wynn grew up far from pack life. Her family taught her: if a pack finds you, run or die - the brutes take no prisoners. When she moved to Santa Cruz, she knew she could hide from the werewolf leader, he seemed like an idiot. But even though a new, smarter leader takes over the Pacific Pack, Wynn continues to hide. After the shock of finding her friend dead, the last thing Wynn expects is a beautiful werewolf officer from the local pack to come into her life.</p> <p>Bexlee, a member of the Coastal Pack, works on the police force. She and her partner spend most of their days hunting down leads on a string of deaths that, to humans, seem natural. How can a heart attack be foul play? Then she runs into a lone wolf no one in the pack knows about. All werewolves need to check in with the pack leader, but this one has been in town for over a year. What is this intriguing woman hiding?</p>"; 
